<title>UK: EBRD takes stake in East Europe insurance fund.</title>
<headline>EBRD takes stake in East Europe insurance fund.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Bank for Reconstruction and Development is to co-invest with New Europe Insurance Ventures $25 mile placement to raise up to a total of $75 million.</p>
<p>The EBRD has already invested in seven insurance companies in the region.</p>
<p>-- David Chance London newsroom 44 171 542 5887</p>
</text>
